    <string name="cosmo_run_title">COSMO RUN</string>
    <string name="cosmo_run_subtitle">Five lanes. Three worlds. One escape through the stars.</string>
    <string name="cosmo_run_instructions">CONTROLS\nSwipe left / right to change lanes, up to jump, down to slide. A tap also jumps. Lift your finger between swipes. The four buttons work too.\n\nREAD THE TRACK\nCargo crates: change lanes.\nAmber hurdles and dark breaches: jump or go around.\nPink laser gates and hovering drones: slide or go around.\nFollow the amber atoms: they mark a clear route.\n\nEQUIPMENT\nCyan shield: absorbs one collision, including a breach. You start each run with one.\nPurple magnet: attracts atoms from all five lanes for 9 seconds.\nPink overdrive: invulnerability and attraction for 6 seconds.\n\nPROGRESSION\nChain atoms to raise your score multiplier up to ×5. A 2.8-second gap resets the chain. Complete contracts for 1,000 points each and unlock suits after 3 and 9 contracts. Contract progress carries over between runs. Worlds change every 600 m. Neutrinos follow the usual distance reward.\n\nPause before leaving: you can bank your run from the pause menu.</string>
